Provenance

The frontend source code was written from 2026-05-15 in Svelte 5, in a
new directory tree, following the rewrite plan in
`../docs/mikerust-ui-rewrite-plan.md`. It replaced the Next.js frontend
forked from the AGPL-3.0 project "Mike" (github.com/willchen96/mike),
which was removed from the repository on 2026-05-17.

Some English interface strings in `locales/` were originally written for
Mike's interface; they remain copyright of Will Chen and the Mike
contributors under AGPL-3.0. See `../NOTICE.md`.
